{"synopsis":"Ini kehidupanku yang ke100\nGenre kehidupan kali ini adalah fantasi\nTapi apa aku menjadi seorang pangeran\nIbuku adalah seorang pembantu dan ayahku seorang raja\nNamun aku hanyalah seorang pangeran yang dilahirkan dari keluarga rendahan\nTapi ini sebenarnya bagus\nYa Bagiku ini sangat bagus\nTidak ada pengikut dan tidak ada hak suksesi\nMaksudku orangorang tidak terlalu memperhatikan keberadaanku","alternative_title":"How the Pro in His Past Life Sucks the Sweet","author":"Song Sooha","artist":"","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"314753d0-82fd-49a2-a6a8-fc56a77933d7","number":"98","chapter":"98","title":"","date":"2024-11-26","released":"2024-11-26"},{"chapter_id":"9946b6e4-c391-400b-89c4-f32e18096249","number":"97","chapter":"97","title":"","date":"2024-12-02","released":"2024-12-02"},{"chapter_id":"18d3f6c6-b7e3-4117-ad6c-6658edcbeb79","number":"96","chapter":"96","title":"","date":"2024-11-26","released":"2024-11-26"},{"chapter_id":"9a5661e5-4c6b-4e5e-9c2e-72bf32287332","number":"95","chapter":"95","title":"","date":"2024-11-26","released":"2024-11-26"},{"chapter_id":"8faf3938-91ff-4bea-80b2-ecb4f70a91b1","number":"94","chapter":"94","title":"","date":"2024-11-25","released":"2024-11-25"},{"chapter_id":"cabab8dc-ad4d-4b11-baf5-56128979e679","number":"93","chapter":"93","title":"","date":"2024-12-02","released":"2024-12-02"},{"chapter_id":"9eab9edf-9b0b-40eb-83ec-35177a3f80b4","number":"92","chapter":"92","title":"","date":"2024-12-02","released":"2024-12-02"},{"chapter_id":"3afac64c-4ec9-425a-9434-1c5adf638aae","number":"91","chapter":"91","title":"","date":"2024-11-25","released":"2024-11-25"},{"chapter_id":"98f58d0e-634a-41fe-881e-bb4da9fc5905","number":"90","chapter":"90","title":"","date":"2024-12-02","released":"2024-12-02"},{"chapter_id":"cd816035-508a-424f-b414-ce572c4750f1","number":"89","chapter":"89","title":"","date":"2024-11-25","released":"2024-11-25"},{"chapter_id":"b6d03b38-ea6f-40b6-971b-438413302f56","number":"88","chapter":"88","title":""